#6500
The Dwarven Caves~
   Beneath the fertile rolling hills lies a complex of mineral formations and
color as rare and unique as they are beautiful.  These jewels of nature which
took millions of years to grow, are preserved in the spectacular sights of the
Dwarven Caverns.  Be sure to visit the Dwarven Papermill and make sure to pick
up a gift for your friend at the Hide and Tooth Gift Shop.  Don't forget the
Famous Magical Mirror Maze!    
~
