#6501
The Entrance Hall~
The Entrance Hall is the only known entrance to the caverns, used by the
original Native inhabitants, early settlers, outlaws, and, of course, 
modern adventurer. It was during the excavation of this room that the Dwarven
workers unearthed the first of several artifacts and treasures to be found in 
the caverns
~
