#6502
The Cavern~
   The entrance to the cavern is gloomy and runs east and west, but preserves
its height, which is from thirty to thirty-six feet, while its width is from
fifty to fiftyfive feet.  Its soil or bottom is uneven, sometimes rising, and
at others falling.    
~
