#6503
The Cavern~
   Even the earliest men who lived in this valley several hundred years ago,
hunting bear and rhinoceros with stone weapons, must have been in awe of these
great caves for they had already existed for millions of years.  When, much
later, the Celtic people were moving into the land, they found the caves a safe
and even comfortable place to live - inside, the temperature is a constant 11
Celsius.    
~
