#6507
The Cavern~
   The brave monk followed her and they met again in the shadowy depths of an
inner cavern.  Quickly, Father Bernard scooped up a handful of water from the
river, blessed it and threw it over the witch.  She turned instantly to stone
and her frozen figure remains in this cavern - known as The Witchs Kitchen - to
this day.    
~
