#6510
The Cavern~
   The water in the multi-jet fountain literally dances to the music; the
height and combination of the water plumes are controlled directly by tonal
variations within the music via state-of-the-art Dwarven magic.  A magic
processor analyses the music, converting the sound spectrum into a multitude of
control channels.  These then operate the water valves in synchronisation with
the music and the pulsating coloured lights surrounding the fountain.    
~
