#6552
Hyena Den~
   Archaeologists reckon that Hyena Den was occupied by hyenas and man
alternatively between 35,000 and 25,000 BC.  It seems that packs of hyenas
drove their in to the cave to corner them and kill them.  There is even a
theory that early man may have done the same!    
~
