#6561
The Canal~
   The canal was dug to bring the waters of the River Axe from the cave mouth
to the Samsera.  Building the canal dam raised the water level in the caves by
about 1.  5 metres - flooding most of the caves in the process.  The water in
the canal is so clear that it appears to be shallow and still.  It is in fact
two metres deep and flowing steadily.    
~
